      <h1>About</h1>
      <p>This project is built like a hidden map made of stories. Each piece of content is a waypoint, a question, or a strategy inside a larger landscape.</p>
      <p>Instead of a linear library, the site lets you move through levels and zones. The map, graph, and library are three ways to explore the same world.</p>
      <p>The metaphor is simple: ideas travel through corridors, and the site is a space where connections become visible, not just listed.</p>
